doing and be good at it.

00:03:37.867 --> 00:03:39.410
There's a lot of people
who love what they do

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:40.530
and they're okay at it.

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.300
There's a lot of people
that crush at something

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:43.393
but fucking hate it.

00:03:44.607 --> 00:03:46.402
And the only way you'll know that

00:03:46.402 --> 00:03:48.033
is if you taste more.

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:52.240
I always smile when I'm on this kick

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:54.180
because I think about oysters a lot.

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:55.401
So like I'm really into them

00:03:55.401 --> 00:03:58.340
and I've gotten pretty
knowledgeable about them,

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.409
like west coast, east coast,
like that kind of shit

00:04:00.409 --> 00:04:02.170
and it's just so funny

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:04.210
how many people have decided
they don't like oysters

