00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:21.010
And I think about that every day.

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:23.150
My job at the top of this whole thing

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:25.300
is to put players in
a position to succeed.

00:04:26.623 --> 00:04:29.210
The nature of where you are in your life

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:31.860
