- [Female] So I'm from
the largest concentration

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:58.540
of Arabs and Muslims anywhere
outside of the Middle East.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:00.880
That's Dearborn, Michigan
right outside of Detroit.

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:02.670
And what I think my purpose is

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:05.866
is to put my city on the map.

00:05:05.866 --> 00:05:07.330
So I've learned

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:09.350
through talking to people
outside of my community

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:10.630
that people are aware of it,

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:11.780
which was really interesting

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:13.530
'cause when you grow up in that

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:15.316
and you're a part of that community

00:05:15.316 --> 00:05:17.770
you don't see the value in it.

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:19.290
And so as I've gotten
older, I guess like--

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:20.770
- 'Cause it's your norm.

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:21.690
- It's my norm

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:23.060
and everybody looks
like me, talks like me.

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:23.920
- It's your norm.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:24.753
- Right.

00:05:24.753 --> 00:05:25.913
And so I guess like

00:05:25.913 --> 00:05:28.240
just certain experiences
that I went through,

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:32.470
my dad was the first
Arab Muslim administrator

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:33.900
