00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:37.180
and he got a lot of
Islamophobia and just hatred

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:38.660
and hate speech in the media.

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:40.680
And so that made me really passionate

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:43.153
