00:05:49.065 --> 00:05:50.720
and recently ABC,

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:52.960
I don't know why I'm so nervous

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:53.983
talking about it right now,

00:05:53.983 --> 00:05:55.780
but ABC Nightline just reached out

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:57.660
and so now we're getting
national attention

00:05:57.660 --> 00:05:59.290
which is like a dream come true.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.912
I obviously was crying all
night last night about it

00:06:01.912 --> 00:06:03.680
'cause it just happened yesterday.

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:04.520
- That's awesome.

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:05.501
- I'm trying to figure out

00:06:05.501 --> 00:06:08.030
