like wildfire in my community

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:13.440
and that's what's helped
us get that attention.

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:17.563
But also so like using that niche but not,

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:21.480
not relying on the niche of the community

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:23.360
to get that global
attention 'cause that's,

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:24.193
at the end of the day,

00:06:24.193 --> 00:06:26.580
we want to be the ones telling our stories

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:28.810
because anyone whose talking
about Arabs and Muslims

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:29.643
globally right now

00:06:29.643 --> 00:06:31.540
aren't doing so from our perspective

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:33.321
and are misrepresenting us.

00:06:33.321 --> 00:06:35.550
And I kind of want to create a universe

00:06:35.550 --> 00:06:37.470
where we're the ones holding the mic

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:38.670
when we're telling our stories.

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:40.240
- Well that's called the internet.

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:41.480
You're not gonna create it,

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:42.350
I didn't create it,

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:43.800
it's been created.

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:44.633
What people don't understand

00:06:44.633 --> 00:06:46.157
is we're going through cycles.

00:06:46.157 --> 00:06:50.780
So even if you think about
it at the highest levels,

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:53.937
there's so much more
conversation today about privacy

00:06:53.937 --> 00:06:57.180
that nobody talked about
privacy eight years ago,

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:59.700
everything was about share everything.

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:01.620
This is just pendulum swings.

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:02.453
To your point,

00:07:02.453 --> 00:07:07.000
right now, just like Jews in
Europe in the '40s and '50s

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:09.700
and African Americans in
the '50s, '60s and '70s,

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.890
these are just moments in cultural time.

00:07:11.890 --> 00:07:14.260
Depending on how you see life,

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:15.687
you either have the serendipity

00:07:15.687 --> 00:07:20.020
or the unluck of being who
you are during this time

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:21.900
when it is your subculture

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:25.340
that is on the global pedestal currently

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:27.150
with a lot of people who
want to control the narrative

00:07:27.150 --> 00:07:28.373
in a negative light.

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:33.060
The reality is you cried out of happiness

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:34.900
