trying to fight against.

00:07:37.397 --> 00:07:40.548
This is what the funny
thing is this whole game is.

00:07:40.548 --> 00:07:42.690
We are in such a macro framework

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.420
that you view that as a good thing

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:45.650
because you understand the benefits

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:47.100
of the national exposure.

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:49.034
You have no post production control.

00:07:49.034 --> 00:07:50.130
- Exactly.

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:52.440
- Like I'm sure some,

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:54.602
I assume at some level you're aware of me

00:07:54.602 --> 00:07:59.602
which means you understand
that I'm highly prolific

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:01.831
