00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:06.683
getting mainstream media attention.

00:08:07.847 --> 00:08:10.234
I didn't even like the
Business Insider article

00:08:10.234 --> 00:08:13.940
that was written that was
a pro piece for VaynerMedia

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:15.210
