00:08:20.553 --> 00:08:22.020
to show a hedge

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:24.940
'cause anybody who writes
an article about a company

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:26.510
has to show some negativity

00:08:26.510 --> 00:08:31.210
so it doesn't look like
a press release thus,

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:32.310
I didn't even read it,

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:35.300
didn't even read it.

00:08:35.300 --> 00:08:37.620
So couple things,

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:39.010
great news,

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:40.640
you do have the control.

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:42.930
The question is do you have the patience?

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:44.490
You know one of the things
I'm most excited about

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:45.530
if you follow me on Instagram

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:46.870
is I'm getting to show these videos

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:48.700
from eight and 10 years ago

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:50.150
where I'm saying the same shit.

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:52.605
And so when I pontificate
to you guys patience

00:08:52.605 --> 00:08:56.560
it's one thing when I say
it now and you hear it

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:58.160
and you're like easy for you to say

00:08:58.160 --> 00:08:59.510
except I actually lived it.

00:09:01.495 --> 00:09:04.840
You can't rely on the local community,

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:07.170
not because of anything other than

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:09.210
that's just not how the internet works.

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:12.430
One person shares one thing
on one piece of platform

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:15.267
and it gets picked up in Russia and then,

00:09:15.267 --> 00:09:18.050
the nature of communication
on the internet

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:20.000
is not localized.

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.320
It is inherently viral

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:23.380
if it speaks the truth.

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:24.300
What you need to do

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:26.105
if you have this mission accomplish

00:09:26.105 --> 00:09:28.300
is worry about your actions,

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:30.310
not anybody else's.

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:32.320
The biggest problem in
our society right now

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:34.110
is everybody worries
about everybody's actions

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:34.943
but their own

00:09:38.730 --> 00:09:40.550
on every side of the equation.

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:41.930
So what I tell you to do

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:43.190
is what I'm doing for a living

00:09:43.190 --> 00:09:48.190
which is I have unbelievable social wants

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:49.640
of kindness for the world

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:51.550
but I'm not gonna allow my friends

00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:53.370
to tell me how to do that.

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:55.050
My friends tell me

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:57.870
I need to be a keyboard
warrior on Twitter.

00:09:57.870 --> 00:09:59.330
I think they're full of shit

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:01.260
and trying to look good on social media

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:02.610
but don't live their truth.

00:10:04.074 --> 00:10:05.802
- So it's about understanding

00:10:05.802 --> 00:10:08.010
the unique perspective that you bring

00:10:08.010 --> 00:10:11.770
and not letting other people
kind of like play with that?

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:12.960
- In action.

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:16.360
Meaning continue to do your podcast,

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:17.621
continue to put out content,

00:10:17.621 --> 00:10:19.746
continue to wear your tee shirt

00:10:19.746 --> 00:10:22.520
but not worry about what
anybody else is doing with it

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:25.713
because when you try to
boil the ocean, you don't.

00:10:27.102 --> 00:10:29.051
When you're gonna put your town on the map

00:10:29.051 --> 00:10:30.670
as such a young woman,

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:31.509
you're gonna lose

00:10:31.509 --> 00:10:33.298
because putting your town on the map

00:10:33.298 --> 00:10:35.283
is gonna take you 54 years.

00:10:40.624 --> 00:10:43.360
So that's how I think about it.

00:10:43.360 --> 00:10:44.962
And not that Nightline's bad

00:10:44.962 --> 00:10:47.890
but you need to be thoughtful
of what you're say,

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:49.563
the way you're framing it is right,

00:10:49.563 --> 00:10:52.823
the concern I have for
you and every other human

00:10:52.823 --> 00:10:54.779
is lack of patience

00:10:54.779 --> 00:10:57.323
and ideology over practicality.

